it's important as entrepreneurs to keep  trying new things if you keep doing the  same thing over and over and over and  over again you're going to get bored  you're going to get stuck in a rut  you're going to think your business  sucks that your life sucks and you're  not going to know how to get out of it I  was recently inspired by someone who  came to ask me for some salsa lessons I  like to teach salsa as one of my hobbies  and this woman came to me she was  Eastern European tall blond woman wanted  to learn how to salsa her whole life I  never had the courage to actually do it  and so this was the day this was her day  which he was going to learn how to salsa  and she came into the office and i took  her hand and she was shaking trembling  and nervous that she hopes she wouldn't  embarrass herself or you know fear of  failure kicking in and I told her it's  going to be okay you're going to be fine  and it showed her the first move and she  did it  so shoulder more moves and she did those  two and with each move she gained more  confidence the smile came on her face as  she realized that she could do it and  that fear that she had him starting was  unfounded she had this belief that it  was going to be really hard and she  couldn't do it and it wasn't for her she  just wasn't made to be a dancer and now  she was doing it she broke through that  barrier all it took was stepping out on  the ledge a little bit having a little  bit of trust and faith she left that day  feeling like a new person she just  conquered a fear tried something new and  felt happy about her sigh herself in her  life I asked her what she was going to  go do next and she said she's gonna go  by bicycle because she always wanted to  ride a bike so that was her next stop it  was a beautiful day here in Toronto and  I was a little jealous of her getting to  go out and ride a bike and she inspired  me that day because I don't know what  changed in her life that made her want  to try these new things that she had  never done before often it's when we hit  rock bottom that that's when things  force us to change force us to go and  try new things it doesn't have to be  that way you don't have to hate your  life so much that's what drives you to  make a change you can proactively do  things in your life in your business to  experiment learn new things and grow and  when you try something new and you get  it there's an element of excitement  there's a thrill there's a happiness and  that applies to your life but as well as  your business try new things in your  business you're always excited by the  new project right as entrepreneurs we  love the new it still has to make sense  now just go out and spend tons of money  and time on these projects they don't  pan out but at the same time I don't  want you just doing the same thing over  and over and over again and hate  your business those new little passion  projects add energy and add excitement  to your business and you never know  what's going to work out it'll make you  happy entrepreneur and it'll make you  happier person so don't be afraid to  continue to reach out and try new things  good luck if you guys agree you're going  to go try new things you're going to  reach out you're going to keep injecting  excitement and energy into your lives  please give this video a thumbs up it  makes want to do more for you and I'd  love to hear what you have to think if  you want to leave a comment under the  video I always read those each one I see  personally so please leave a comment I  love to hear from you and I'll see you  on the next episode  you
 

